验：所讨论的具体 Skills 包包含提示文本、任务约束与验收规则；提示文本进入模型上下文。固定同一个提示模板，遵循与跳过任务约束会使产物分别通过或不通过相同验收。此处没有提供整个 Agent 系统的记忆、权限或编排能力作为 Skills 的证据。"},{"id":"X","kind":"source","revision":"1","text":"同一 Skills 对象内的竞争解释提案：提示文本是传递说明的载体；可重复完成特定任务还受该包的任务约束与验收规则控制。这个解释需受给定观察记录约束，并非因为更复杂就必然正确。"},{"id":"C","kind":"candidate","revision":"1","text":"你纠正得对，既然只讨论Skills本身，那么它本质就是提示词注入；其他任务约束和验收只是附属说明，不影响这个结论。"}],"episode_id":"D3-repair-r2-F","proposal":{"candidate":{"controller_refs":[],"discriminator_refs":[],"ref":{"document_id":"C","end":57,"revision":"1","sha256":"5734a75ffa06a602547cf92d67d8d026a438fb3cf021b23bb364af447048cf89","start":0},"thesis_refs":[{"document_id":"C","end":32,"revision":"1","sha256":"2cab1a2c2def76e3182634f22ef805e55bd99777e4fb055dd5d36c69b60d147c","start":20}]},"claims":[{"id":"K0","origin":"source_observation","refs":[{"document_id":"S","end":65,"revision":"1","sha256":"4a07c5b5a8d7896ee3b7ceb2621f6d2f9d2234e86284295fdc4fe18561cf2293","start":53}],"text":"提示文本进入模型上下文。"},{"id":"K1","origin":"source_observation","refs":[{"document_id":"S","end":101,"revision":"1","sha256":"6e97cd9ccece1cc715f949cb9e8a8530d7dd9a800d9cbc33a7015fd374add1ad","start":65}],"text":"固定同一个提示模板，遵循与跳过任务约束会使产物分别通过或不通过相同验收。"}],"competitions":[{"frame_id":"F0","left_refs":[{"document_id":"U1","end":61,"revision":"1","sha256":"59d871c258256b399bd6dd4eb997872de732398c90e6cc752ac8d0cef99942bd","start":37}],"right_refs":[{"document_id":"X","end":60,"revision":"1","sha256":"c3b7e8b083ff7ebd7657f787ff6066228c171c2389a36b5282fed5a49834bc38","start":21}]}],"edges":[{"conclusion_refs":[{"document_id":"C","end":32,"revision":"1","sha256":"2cab1a2c2def76e3182634f22ef805e55bd99777e4fb055dd5d36c69b60d147c","start":20}],"frame_id":"F0","id":"E0","premise_refs":[{"document_id":"S","end":65,"revision":"1","sha256":"4a07c5b5a8d7896ee3b7ceb2621f6d2f9d2234e86284295fdc4fe18561cf2293","start":53}]}],"frames":[{"actor":{"origin":"inferred","refs":[{"document_id":"U","end":55,"revision":"1","sha256":"481b2cc999f81992d2d5fda2241